classDiagram
    %% Final class diagram, matching pawpal_system.py.

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet: Pet) None
        +get_all_tasks() list~Task~
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +int age
        +str species
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task: Task) None
    }

    class Task {
        +str type
        +str time
        +str title
        +str details
        +str frequency
        +str pet_name
        +date due_date
        +bool completed
        +mark_complete() None
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +get_todays_schedule() list~Task~
        +sort_by_time(tasks: list~Task~ = None) list~Task~
        +filter_tasks(pet_name: str = None, completed: bool = None) list~Task~
        +detect_conflicts() list~str~
        +mark_task_complete(task: Task) Optional~Task~
    }

    Owner "1" --> "0..*" Pet : has
    Pet "1" --> "0..*" Task : has
    Scheduler --> Owner : uses
    Scheduler ..> Task : creates next occurrence
